---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro"
---

<Layout title="Experiences — Scudra" description="Interactive cloud agent experiences built by Scudra.">
  <section class="sc-container py-20">
    <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-ink-muted mb-4" data-reveal>
      Experiences
    </p>
    <h1 class="font-serif text-[clamp(2.25rem,5vw,3.5rem)] leading-[1.1] tracking-tight mb-4" data-reveal>
      Interactive experiences
    </h1>
    <p class="text-ink-muted max-w-[55ch] mb-12 leading-relaxed" data-reveal>
      These are not static demos. They are real agents you can run, inspect, and fork.
    </p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <article id="blindspot" class="p-6 bg-paper-warm rounded-sc border border-black/5" data-reveal>
        <p class="text-[0.7rem] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-ink-muted mb-3">Live</p>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl mb-2">Blindspot</h2>
        <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed mb-6">
          A privacy-preserving onchain investigation agent. Search an ENS name and watch the dossier declassify as the agent works.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a href="/experiences/blindspot" class="sc-button-accent">Open dossier</a>
          <a href="/recipes/blindspot" class="sc-button-secondary">Read recipe</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="p-6 bg-paper-warm rounded-sc border border-black/5" data-reveal>
        <p class="text-[0.7rem] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-ink-muted mb-3">Live</p>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl mb-2">The Builder</h2>
        <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Prompt. Boot. Build. Vanish. An agent writes an app, boots it in a sandbox with a live preview URL, then destroys it — and the URL becomes a tombstone.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a href="/experiences/builder" class="sc-button-accent">Open experience</a>
          <a href="/recipes/the-builder" class="sc-button-secondary">Read recipe</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="p-6 bg-paper-warm rounded-sc border border-black/5 opacity-65" data-reveal>
        <p class="text-[0.7rem] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-ink-muted mb-3">In the lab</p>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl mb-2">The Witness</h2>
        <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed mb-6">
          The same URL, seen from three countries at once. Stealth browsers on residential proxies visit a page from the US, Germany, and Singapore — then diff what each location saw.
        </p>
        <a href="/experiences/witness" class="inline-block sc-button-secondary opacity-75">
          In the lab
        </a>
      </article>

      <article class="p-6 bg-paper-warm rounded-sc border border-black/5" data-reveal>
        <p class="text-[0.7rem] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-ink-muted mb-3">Live</p>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl mb-2">The Analyst</h2>
        <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Blast Radius Zero. An LLM writes code that runs in a locked-down, throwaway container — with self-repair, a containment board, and signed run receipts.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a href="https://149.248.9.254.sslip.io" class="sc-button-accent">Open demo</a>
          <a href="/experiences/analyst" class="sc-button-secondary">About</a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
